# OpenPERouter high-level test plan workflow

## Draft vs publish

| User intent | Agent action |
| ----------- | ------------ |
| Create / generate high-level plan | Validate; return **full markdown in chat**. Do **not** publish to Google Docs. |
| Publish / upload high-level plan to Google Docs | `scripts/validate_and_publish_test_plan.sh` with stdin markdown; return Docs URL. |

## Phase gate

Do **not** start `openpe-detailed-test-plan`, Polarion procedure publish, Phase 3 execution, or Phase 4 automation for the same Epic until the user **explicitly approves** the high-level plan.

Full phase map: `.cursor/skills/openpe-detailed-test-plan/references/openpe-qe-lifecycle.mdc`.
